{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35623","headline":"司天台 · 李山甫","name":"司天台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拂云朱槛捧昭回，静对铜浑水镜开。\n太史只知频奏瑞，苍生无计可防灾。\n景公进德星曾退，汉帝推诚日爲回。\n何事旷官全不语，好天良月锁高台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}